{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-1541","published":"2026-03-15T11:10:33Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:36.692687988Z","upstream":["CVE-2024-47866"],"summary":"ceph security update","details":"Ceph is a massively scalable, open-source, distributed storage system that runs on commodity hardware and delivers object, block and file system storage.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nCeph is a distributed object, block, and file storage platform. In versions up to and including 19.2.3, using the argument `x-amz-copy-source` to put an object and specifying an empty string as its content leads to the RGW daemon crashing, resulting in a DoS attack. As of time of publication, no known patched versions exist.(CVE-2024-47866)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"ceph","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/ceph&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["ceph-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ceph-base-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ceph-common-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ceph-debuginfo-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ceph-debugsource-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ceph-exporter-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ceph-fuse-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ceph-immutable-object-cache-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ceph-mds-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ceph-mgr-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ceph-mon-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ceph-osd-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ceph-radosgw-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ceph-selinux-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","ceph-test-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","cephfs-mirror-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","libcephfs-devel-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","libcephfs2-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","libcephsqlite-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","libcephsqlite-devel-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","librados-devel-18.2.2-11.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","librados2-18.2.2-1